# Cancellation conditions reported by simplify.  These are all correct:
# the excluded point is exactly where the cancelled denominator is zero.
simplify (x**2-1)/(x-1)
simplify (x**2+2*x+1)/(x+1)
simplify ((x+1)/(x-1))*((x-1)/(x+1))
simplify 3/(x) + 3/(-x)
simplify (x+1)/(x**2-1)
simplify (x**2-1)/((x-1)*(x+1))
simplify (x**3-1)/((x-1)*(x**2+x+1))
simplify exp(log(x))
